    "updated_at": "2025-10-11T20:09:28Z",
    "body": "Yea, I think the only solution to this will be to sort and filter server side. @Meierschlumpf do you agree?\nInstead of https://qbittorrent.vercel.app/classes/QBittorrent.html#getalldata , we need to use https://qbittorrent.vercel.app/classes/QBittorrent.html#listtorrents . We should also exclude more data from the JSON, it will result in higher memory usage.",
